Yep. Only the good die young.

170
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:09,240
老师说 浣熊只在夜间行动
But in school, we learn raccoons are nocturnal.

171
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:10,460
白天都在睡觉
They sleep during the day.

172
00:07:10,580 --> 00:07:13,860
当然 这一只可能是半夜起来找零食的
They sure do, and this one must've got up for a midnight snack.

173
00:07:13,940 --> 00:07:14,940
我们人也有类似的经历嘛
You know, we've all done that.

174
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:16,280
-应该是吧 -是啊
- I guess so. -Yeah.

175
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:17,300
现在都能说得通了
It all adds up.

176
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:20,740
我现在无法待在这个房间 太多回忆了
I don't think I can be in here right now. Too many memories.

177
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:22,280
他会没事的
He'll be okay.

178
00:07:24,828 --> 00:07:26,551
-你撒谎 -什么
- You lie. - What?

179
00:07:26,620 --> 00:07:30,500
在哥伦比亚 骗局我见一个识破一个
I'm Colombian. I know a fake crime scene when I see one.

180
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,840
我当时想把那幅画钉在墙上
I was hanging up the new poster

181
00:07:32,980 --> 00:07:35,720
结果它掉下来砸在小壳身上 纯属意外
and it fell on top of him. It was an accident.

182
00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:36,780
去跟他说实话
You have to tell him.

183
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:38,660
不行 我有经验
No. I've been through this before.

184
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:41,640
米奇尔九岁的时候 他让我照看他的鸟
When Mitchell was nine, I was supposed to take care of his bird.

185
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,500
结果它飞了出去 撞上了一台电扇
It got out and flew into a fan.

186
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,260
那场面就像血花四溅的枕头大战
It was like a bloody pillow fight.

187
00:07:45,420 --> 00:07:46,940
老天 你到底杀过多少只宠物
My God. How many pets have you killed?

188
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:47,600
就这两只
Just the two.

189
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:49,900
我不小心害死了那只鸟 是大错特错
I took the heat on the bird. It was a big mistake.

190
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:51,940
直到今天 米奇尔看我的眼神
To this day, Mitchell looks at me,

191
00:07:51,940 --> 00:07:52,620
都好像在说
I see him thinking,

192
00:07:52,620 --> 00:07:54,654
"芙莱莎·米奈丽就是被这个人杀死的"
"That's the guy who killed Fliza Minnelli."

193
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,760
要是曼尼发现了 你又要怎么办
And what if he finds out? Then what?

194
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:59,680
到时候你不仅是宠物杀手 还是个骗子
You'll be the guy that killed his pet and lied to him.

195
00:07:59,700 --> 00:08:01,700
他不会发现的 我已经掩盖好自己的"行迹"了
He's not gonna find out because I covered my tracks.

196
00:08:03,020 --> 00:08:03,400
好吧
Okay.

197
00:08:05,051 --> 00:08:07,124
芙莱莎·米奈丽
Fliza Minnelli?

198
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,920
我当时怎么就没发现他是同性恋呢
How did I not know that kid was gay?

199
00:08:12,180 --> 00:08:12,840
嗨 卢克
Hey, Luke.

200
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:14,480
今天可是你的大日子
Big day for you, huh?

201
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:15,260
为什么
Why?

202
00:08:15,323 --> 00:08:18,318
-你终于可以见到你的亲妈了 -什么
- Because you will get to meet your real mom. - What?

203
00:08:18,393 --> 00:08:21,940
本来大家说好 等你21岁再告诉你
We all made a pact we'd deny it until you turned 21.

204
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:25,280
但是爸爸的前女友就是为这事来的
But that's the real reason Dad's old girlfriend's coming over.

205
00:08:25,740 --> 00:08:26,580
她才是你亲妈
She's your mom,

206
00:08:26,580 --> 00:08:29,200
要是她喜欢你 你就得跟她生活了
and if she likes you, you'll go live with her.

207
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:32,300
我才不是被领养的 我要去问妈妈
I'm not adopted. I'm asking Mom.

208
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:36,020
你是说邓菲太太吗 她不会跟你说实话的
You mean Mrs. Dunphy? She's not going to tell you the truth.

209
00:08:36,971 --> 00:08:38,420
我不是
I-I'm not-

210
00:08:38,420 --> 00:08:38,840
我知道
I know.

211
00:08:42,194 --> 00:08:47,382
就因为他说你是呆家呆户的推销员吗
Just 'cause he called you a dork-to-dork salesman?

212
00:08:47,450 --> 00:08:49,678
姐全力回击
The empire shakes back.

213
00:08:50,860 --> 00:08:51,780
浣熊爪有5个指头
Raccoons have five toes.

214
00:08:51,980 --> 00:08:52,500
什么
What's that?

215
00:08:53,220 --> 00:08:54,580
我不想来烦你
I don't mean to bother you.

216
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:55,698
但我很疑惑
It's just confusing.

217
00:08:55,698 --> 00:08:58,626
我房间里浣熊的两只脚印都只有4个指头
The footprints in my room only have four toes.

218
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,860
我知道怎么回事
You know, I bet I know what happened.

219
00:09:00,928 --> 00:09:03,822
它肯定是在一场打斗中失去了两个指头
I'll bet he lost those toes in a fight.

220
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:06,080
那家伙看起来像是经过了几场打斗
And that guy looked like he'd been in a brawl or two.

221
00:09:06,740 --> 00:09:08,460
-刚好一只爪失去一个指头 -有可能
- One toe from each foot? - Maybe.

222
00:09:09,460 --> 00:09:11,680
曼尼 只有一件事
You know, Manny, I think the only thing...

223
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:14,280
可以让你不再问这样的问题
that's gonna get you to stop asking all these questions...

224
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:16,340
就是 一个永久性的告别
is for you to have a little closure.

225
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,080
什么意思
What do you mean?

226
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:19,300
给小壳举办一场小型追悼会吧
Well,I'd like to throw a little memorial for Shel.

227
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:21,340
那对我们大家都好
It'll be good for all of us.

228
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:23,360
那样就可以把悲痛发泄出来
That way we get our grief out,

229
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:27,660
之后谁都不要再提这件事 永远不提
and then we never have to talk about this ever, ever again.

230
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:35,680
嗨 当心脚下
Hi. Oh, careful. There's a thing.

231
00:09:35,787 --> 00:09:37,678
见到你真高兴
Yeah. Good to see you.

232
00:09:39,686 --> 00:09:41,694
-嗨 -嗨 我是克莱尔
- Hi! Oh, my God. - Hi. I'm Claire.

233
00:09:41,801 --> 00:09:43,653
你就是 嗨
You must be- Oh. Yeah. Hi.

234
00:09:43,751 --> 00:09:45,642
-丹妮丝 -是的
- Denise. - Well- Okay.

235
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:49,160
你本人比菲尔上传的照片还要漂亮
You're even prettier than the pictures that Phil's always posting.

236
00:09:49,380 --> 00:09:50,880
-只有几张 -是吗
- Just a couple. - Oh?

237
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:52,220
瞎说 每周都有
Shut up. Every week.

238
00:09:52,220 --> 00:09:53,420
他喜欢炫耀你的照片
He loves showing you off.

239
00:09:53,476 --> 00:09:55,440
我男友喜欢你在阿卡普尔科照的那几张
And my boyfriend likes your Acapulco pictures,

240
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,740
喜欢得我都有点吃醋了
probably a little too much.

241
00:09:57,204 --> 00:09:59,461
替我谢谢你男友
Well, thank your boyfriend for me.

242
00:09:59,540 --> 00:10:00,680
快请进
Come on in, please.

243
00:10:00,743 --> 00:10:05,025
我给你带来一瓶祛皱紧致霜
Oh, I brought you, um, some lifting intensifier.

244
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:07,174
我知道你用不上 不过这是限量版
Not that you need it. It's a limited edition,

245
00:10:07,174 --> 00:10:09,029
-谢谢 谢谢 -不客气
- Thank you. Thank you. - Never mind.

246
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:11,280
丹妮丝 给你介绍我的孩子
Oh, Denise, I think you might know these people.

247
00:10:11,342 --> 00:10:12,870
-这是海莉 -嗨
- Uh, that's Haley - Hi.

248
00:10:12,941 --> 00:10:15,798
-艾丽克斯和 -卢克
- Alex and- - Luke.

249
00:10:15,860 --> 00:10:18,720
他的卷发和我小时候的一模一样
I had curly hair just like that when I was little.

250
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:22,300
那又怎样 说明不了什么
So? That doesn't mean anything.

251
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:28,320
大家都过来 请坐
Why don't we, uh, come on in, have a seat. Please.

252
00:10:29,100 --> 00:10:30,580
爸爸上高中时候是什么样子
So what was my dad like in high school?

253
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:33,346
他的霹雳舞无人超越
Only the most amazing break-dancer ever.

254
00:10:33,455 --> 00:10:36,450
-不可能 -别刺激我 你看 你看
- No way. - Oh, don't fire it up. What? What?

255
00:10:38,126 --> 00:10:40,466
他柜子里有一个大匣子和一块硬纸板
He had a boom box and a piece of cardboard in his locker.

256
00:10:40,565 --> 00:10:42,568
-你那个舞叫什么名字 -O型区
- And what was your dance name? - O-Zone.

257
00:10:42,637 --> 00:10:44,561
我开车送他去搜星节目试镜
I drove him to his Star Search audition.

258
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:46,199
顺便提一下 试镜就是走个形式
Which is totally political, by the way.

259
00:10:46,199 --> 00:10:47,522
O型区
O-Zone.

260
00:10:47,591 --> 00:10:50,560
太搞笑了 我以后就叫你这个
That is dead-ass funny. I'm so calling you that.

261
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:51,200
谢谢
Thank you.

262
00:10:52,260 --> 00:10:53,800
你太走运了
Wow. You really lucked out.

263
00:10:53,860 --> 00:10:56,240
美丽娇妻 豪华住房
You have a beautiful wife, a gorgeous house.

264
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:59,240
还有一群孩子 我都想把卢克带回家去
And those kids- I could take Luke home with me.

265
00:10:59,305 --> 00:11:01,352
不用跟我客气
Well, be my guest.

266
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:02,680
真的 赶紧把他带走吧
Seriously, you go right ahead.

267
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:06,420
不行 我喜欢这个家
No! I like it here!

268
00:11:09,540 --> 00:11:11,540
艾丽克斯 宝贝 看看你弟弟怎么了
Alex, honey, will you go find out what's wrong with your brother?

269
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:12,300
遵命
Okay.

270
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:17,500
如果可以的话 我想去一下
You know, um, if it's okay, I think I'm just gonna use the, um-

271
00:11:17,500 --> 00:11:19,360
当然可以 走廊尽头就是
Oh, yeah. Of course. Down the hall.

272
00:11:19,436 --> 00:11:22,088
-就在左手边 很容易找到 -谢谢
- Left-hand side. You can't miss it. - Thanks.

273
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,880
-我承认她人很棒 -是吗
- Okay, she's fantastic. -Yes?

274
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:28,660
是 我好愧疚
Yes. I feel awful.

275
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:31,240
什么时候起 我变得这么刻薄
When did I become this horribly cynical person...

276
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,860
把别人都往坏处想
who assumes the worst about people?

277
00:11:33,100 --> 00:11:36,060
其实7年前我就发现...你才不是那种人
I first noticed it seven years- You're not.

278
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,860
我太笨了 请问
Such an idiot. Is it-

279
00:11:37,971 --> 00:11:40,813
-我带你过去 没关系的 -谢谢
- Oh, I'll show you. Yeah, yeah, yeah. - Okay. Thanks.

280
00:11:43,743 --> 00:11:46,663
我们要怎么做
So how are we gonna do this?

281
00:11:46,740 --> 00:11:48,560
我以为只要给你指一下门
I thought I'd just point at the door.

282
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:50,540
-所以我只想着 -我也是这么想的
- So I was thinking - I was thinking too.

283
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:54,700
这个 是我酒店的房卡
Here... is my hotel room key.

284
00:11:55,980 --> 00:11:57,640
随时欢迎你
You can come by whenever you want.

285
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:10,280
今天早上挺有意思的 是吧
That was funny this morning, huh-

286
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:12,300
红灯的时候我刚好停在你的车旁边
when I pulled up next to you at that stoplight?

287
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:12,740
有意思
Funny?

288
00:12:13,180 --> 00:12:15,100
对 当时我正在和我老公打电话
Yeah. Because I was on the phone with my partner...

289
00:12:15,100 --> 00:12:18,200
谈论他的上司多讨厌 他的上司
talking about how horrible his boss was- his.

290
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:20,340
然后你刚好停下 所以
And then you pull up. So-

291
00:12:20,340 --> 00:12:22,200
不管怎么说 很高兴路上碰见你
Anyway, I'm glad I ran into you.

292
00:12:22,260 --> 00:12:24,000
我担心他们要把开庭日期提前
I'm getting worried they're gonna move up our court date.

293
00:12:24,300 --> 00:12:25,800
所以你要全力做好准备
I need you to bust ass preparing.

294
00:12:25,889 --> 00:12:27,437
因为一旦周一叫我们去开庭
'Cause if they call us on Monday-

295
00:12:27,499 --> 00:12:29,046
一定要现在看吗
Uh, you need to get that?

296
00:12:29,100 --> 00:12:31,577
不是 没关系 只是一张
No. It's fine. It's just a...

297
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:34,540
我女儿第一次站起来的照片
picture of my daughter standing for the first time.

298
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:36,560
可以理解 确实值得庆祝
Yeah, they do that. It's a big day.

299
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:38,080
无论如何 明天你还要来加班
Anyway, I need you here tomorrow.

300
00:12:38,380 --> 00:12:39,579
我知道明天是周日 但是
I know it's a Sunday, but,

301
00:12:39,579 --> 00:12:41,864
你肯定会准时到的 好吗
uh, you think you can be on time, okay?

302
00:12:43,295 --> 00:12:46,672
其实 明天我有事
Actually, um, I have plans tomorrow,

303
00:12:46,732 --> 00:12:48,779
就不来了
uh, so I won't be here.

304
00:12:48,848 --> 00:12:51,600
我打算明天待在家里
I-I have plans to stay at home

305
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:54,600
和家人一起 什么都不做 就这样
with my family and do absolutely nothing. Okay.

306
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,500
不过周一我还是会来上班
But I will see you on Monday.

307
00:12:57,260 --> 00:12:59,380
你的意思是 这事你说了算
So, you're in charge now, is that it?

308
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:01,740
我才意识到 既然我女儿都能站起来
Well, I just figure if my daughter can stand up,

309
00:13:01,740 --> 00:13:02,560
我也应该起身反抗
then so can I.

310
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:07,300
好了 最近大家加班都很辛苦
All right, look. We've all been working hard lately, okay?

311
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:08,200
但这是工作性质决定的
But that's the job.

312
00:13:08,660 --> 00:13:11,240
明天不来 你就永远不用来了
So either come in tomorrow or don't bother coming back again.

313
00:13:14,140 --> 00:13:14,620
好吧
Okay.

314
00:13:26,201 --> 00:13:28,788
还得用一下证件
Need the, uh, I.D. to

315
00:13:28,860 --> 00:13:31,360
乘电梯下楼 奔向自由
make the elevator go down to freedom...

316
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:34,520
还有咖啡 配合我的行头
and this to complete my set.

317
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:42,440
乌龟 爬行动物 宠物
Turtle, reptile, pet.

318
00:13:42,534 --> 00:13:47,191
小壳·斯坦龟不仅仅是一只乌龟
Shel Turtlestein was many things.

319
00:13:47,300 --> 00:13:49,120
再说下去我就要哭了
I don't think I can do this without crying.

320
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:51,440
不如我们直接跳到吃冷盘的环节吧
Maybe we should just get to the cold cuts.

321
00:13:51,506 --> 00:13:53,334
我们想听完
Well, we wanna hear it.

322
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:55,300
杰 要不你去念吧
Jay, why don't you read it?

323
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:58,120
是你"送它上路"的 记得吗
You were with him at the end. Remember?

324
00:14:05,858 --> 00:14:07,960
"小壳·斯坦龟不仅仅是一只乌龟"
"Shel Turtlestein was many things,"

325
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,320
"最重要的是 它是我的朋友"
"but above all, he was my friend."

326
00:14:09,780 --> 00:14:11,620
"当菲奥娜·冈德森拒绝我的约会请求"
"When I didn't get a date with Fiona Gunderson,"

327
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:13,268
"有小壳的见证"
"Shel was there."

328
00:14:13,340 --> 00:14:15,310
"当我落选特维的角色"
"When I didn't get to play the part of Tevye,"

329
00:14:15,310 --> 00:14:16,869
"有小壳的见证"
"Shel was there."

330
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:19,039
"而当一只浣熊闯入我的房间"
"And when a raccoon broke into my room,"

331
00:14:19,039 --> 00:14:21,606
"不幸的是 小壳也在"
"unfortunately, Shel was there.

332
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:23,320
"跟这位朋友 我说过很多话"
"I said a lot of things to my friend,"

333
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,540
"但最终却来不及跟它说一句再见"
"but the one thing I never got to say was good-bye."

334
00:14:27,100 --> 00:14:29,700
等一下 我知道它是怎么死的了
Stop. I know what really happened.

335
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:32,160
-是吗 -我床边上有一包薯条
- You do? - I left a bag of chips near my bed.

336
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:35,480
浣熊肯定是闻到味了 是我害死了小壳
The raccoon must have smelled it. It's my fault he's dead.

337
00:14:35,578 --> 00:14:37,428
对不起 小壳
Sorry, Shel.

338
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:42,200
杰 有什么话要跟曼尼说吗
Jay, you don't have anything to say to Manny?

339
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:44,420
好吧
Yeah.

340
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,340
曼尼
Manny.

341
00:14:53,860 --> 00:14:55,477
小壳不会怪你的
Shel forgives you.

342
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:56,620
谢谢
Thank you.

343
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:00,510
丹妮丝
Oh, Denise.

344
00:15:01,500 --> 00:15:04,580
这些照片太棒了 谢谢你
These pictures are amazing. Thank you.

345
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,100
亲爱的 你还是卷发呢
Sweetie, that perm.

346
00:15:07,182 --> 00:15:08,855
确切地说是杰里卷
Technically, that's a Jheri curl.

347
00:15:08,900 --> 00:15:12,440
我特喜欢照相 今天还给自己照了一张
I just love to take pictures. I took this one of myself today.

348
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:18,500
话说 我去开一瓶红酒
You know what? I'm gonna open a bottle of wine.

349
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:20,540
不要 千万不要
No. No. That's the worst idea.

350
00:15:20,784 --> 00:15:23,066
别开 我没那个心情
No, no. I'm not in the mood.

351
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:25,280
我是怎么了 像个狼孩一样
What am I, raised by a pack of wolves?

352
00:15:25,418 --> 00:15:27,545
嗨 别闹了
Hey. Come on now.

353
00:15:27,620 --> 00:15:28,100
亲爱的
Honey.

354
00:15:29,660 --> 00:15:31,500
你对丹妮丝的判断也不是一点道理没有
You weren't completely wrong about Denise.

355
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,360
-为什么这么说 -她想要我
- How's that? - She wants me.

356
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:36,080
-干什么 -那个 干她
- To do what? - It. Her.

357
00:15:36,420 --> 00:15:39,680
我说Facebook上的女人不正经
Oh. Oh, this is because of the thing I said about Facebook...

358
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:41,900
大家都在上面约炮 所以你失望了
and everybody's hooking up, and now you're disappointed.

359
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:45,580
不是 她对着我大口咬空气 像这样
No. She bit the air right in front of me. Like that.

360
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:47,140
而且你看她塞给我一个什么
And then look what she tried to give me.

361
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:49,200
-需要我帮忙吗 -不用了
- Anything I can help with? - No.

362
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:50,900
我找不到开瓶器了
I just- I can't find my corkscrew.

363
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:55,280
-摸我 -好了 丹妮丝
- Touch me. - Okay. Denise,

364
00:15:55,620 --> 00:15:57,360
肯定是有什么地方让你误会了
I think somewhere along the line you got the wrong idea.

365
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:59,100
我脑袋里充满想入"菲菲"的误会
My head is full of wrong ideas.

366
00:16:00,060 --> 00:16:03,020
-你的品味真不赖 克莱尔 -谢谢
- You have such great taste, Claire. - Thank you.

367
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:06,020
菲尔当年也是很有品"味"的
I remember Phil used to have really good taste too.

368
00:16:06,124 --> 00:16:07,916
-我用点洗手液 -找到了
- Let me get a little of this. - Oh, here it is.

369
00:16:08,020 --> 00:16:09,740
菲尔 拿几个杯子过来
Phil, would you mind grabbing us a couple glasses?

370
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:10,600
没问题
You betcha.

371
00:16:11,497 --> 00:16:12,806
-要我帮忙"抓"什么吗 -不用
- Need me to grab anything? - No!

372
00:16:12,865 --> 00:16:15,423
-这样太离谱了 -我知道
- Okay, this is so wrong. - I know.

373
00:16:15,532 --> 00:16:17,630
-有她在更刺激不是吗 -不是
- It's way more exciting when she's in the room, isn't it? -No.

374
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:19,280
我还留着拉拉队队长的衣服
I still have my cheerleader outfit.

375
00:16:19,460 --> 00:16:19,980
我也是
So do I.

376
00:16:20,020 --> 00:16:22,820
但还是不能这样 那个怎么碎了
But this still can't happen. When did that break?

377
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:26,420
-你怎么退却了 -我根本没想乱来
- Why are you wussing out? - I never wussed in.

378
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:28,120
那你在Facebook上写那些是为什么
What about all those things you wrote on Facebook?

379
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:30,940
"你还好吗 我脖子好疼"
"How was your day? My neck is so sore."

380
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:32,980
怎么大家都要把留言说的那么下流
Why do people keep adding voices to these things?

381
00:16:32,980 --> 00:16:33,860
我没别的意思
I didn't mean anything.

382
00:16:34,020 --> 00:16:35,660
你是说 我在这段关系上
Are you telling me that I wasted a year

383
00:16:35,660 --> 00:16:37,200
浪费了一年时间
of my life on this relationship?

384
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:38,215
什么关系
What relationship?

385
00:16:38,215 --> 00:16:40,280
还有多少女人被你勾引了
How many other women have you led on?

386
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:41,480
靠 我怎么知道
No, I don't know!

387
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:42,200
菲尔
Phil?

388
00:16:45,740 --> 00:16:46,620
菲尔 亲爱的
Phil, honey.

389
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:50,620
记不记得 我们第一次约会的时候
Do you remember when you broke your arm

390
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:51,520
你的胳膊受伤了
when we were first dating?

391
00:16:51,609 --> 00:16:54,071
记得 我在冰上摔倒了
Yeah, uh, when I slipped on the ice.

392
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,940
是啊 奇怪了 这张照片里
Right. That's so weird. Because in this picture,

393
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:59,500
你带着受伤的胳膊坐在丹妮丝旁边
you're sitting with Denise and you have a broken arm, so-

394
00:16:59,551 --> 00:17:01,280
是 是挺奇怪
Yeah, that's- that's weird.

395
00:17:01,340 --> 00:17:04,320
-你和我约会的时候和她还没断呢 -不是
- So you were still dating her when you started dating me? - No.

396
00:17:04,540 --> 00:17:05,820
-菲尔 -可能是吧
- Phil? - Yeah. Maybe.

397
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:07,980
有段时间 我横跨两条船
There was a time, a little overlap...

398
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:10,580
当时 我打算和丹妮丝分手
when, uh, I was trying to break things off with Denise.

399
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:12,300
那你还带我去圣达菲
You took me to Santa Fe.

400
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:15,580
圣达菲 你当时说是带你爸爸去
Santa Fe? Phil, you told me that was your father.

401
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:18,840
我知道你们很"新疼" 但其实都是旧伤
Okay, I know the pain is fresh, but the lie is really old.

402
00:17:19,360 --> 00:17:22,040
我来就是个错误 我走了
You know, this was a mistake. I'm gonna leave.

403
00:17:23,100 --> 00:17:25,420
克莱尔 我要是你 就把他踢出家门
Claire, if I were you, I would kick him out.

404
00:17:25,600 --> 00:17:26,460
可能他会更加感激你
Maybe he'd appreciate you

405
00:17:26,460 --> 00:17:28,140
让他尝到孤身一人在酒店过夜的滋味
more after he spent a lonely night in a hotel.

406
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:30,740
在机场旁的雷迪森酒店
At the Radisson, by the airport.

407
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:36,260
-你辞职了 -感觉太棒了
- You quit? - It was amazing.

408
00:17:36,620 --> 00:17:37,980
在你眼前的是一个全新的我 小卡
No, no. This is the new me, Cam.

409
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:40,560
我再也不会让别人主宰我的生活
I am not letting people run my life anymore.

410
00:17:40,700 --> 00:17:43,220
我应该紧张才对 但我反而为你激动
I should be nervous, but I'm not. I'm excited for you.

411
00:17:43,260 --> 00:17:45,600
没错 这太令人激动了 太激动了
Yes! It's exciting! It's exciting.

412
00:17:45,600 --> 00:17:48,380
你听从了自己内心的想法 值得庆祝
Because you followed your heart, and that is worth celebrating.

413
00:17:48,580 --> 00:17:49,720
小卡 我觉得自己
Cam, I just feel-

414
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:52,480
彻底解放了
so liberated.

415
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:56,100
我不会去捡起来的
And I'm not picking it up.

416
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:58,540
-我喜欢你这样 -我也是
- I like this guy. - I do too.

417
00:17:58,940 --> 00:18:00,720
当然 我们以后要节俭一些
Yes, we'll have to cut back a little bit.

418
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:02,300
但这值得 不是吗
But isn't it worth it if you feel

419
00:18:02,300 --> 00:18:04,340
第一次为自己而活
like you're living your life for the first time?

420
00:18:04,446 --> 00:18:06,272
-太值得了 -那我们还等什么
- Totally. - What were we even waiting for?

421
00:18:06,340 --> 00:18:07,840
你重操旧业 当音乐老师
You will go back to teaching music,

422
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:10,880
我休息几个月 再找一份工作
and then I'll just find something in a... few months.

423
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:13,420
在那之前 我们只管坐下来
And until then, all we need to do is just sit back...

424
00:18:13,420 --> 00:18:16,480
看着我们的小千金快乐成长
and watch this little miracle here dazzle us.

425
00:18:16,554 --> 00:18:19,136
-我好激动 -我也是
- I'm tingling. - I am too.

426
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:22,160
我的心似乎从没这么充实过
It's like my heart is full for the first time in forever.

427
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,240
老天 心跳得好快
Oh, God, it's really pounding.

428
00:18:24,740 --> 00:18:25,980
我能感受到
It's like I feel the weight of

429
00:18:25,980 --> 00:18:28,200
我的胸口充满了一切可能
endless possibilities just sitting on my chest-

430
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:29,900
她什么表现都没有 小卡
She is not doing anything, Cam.

431
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:30,840
你不是慌乱了吧
You're not panicking, are you?

432
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:32,360
-我当然慌乱了 -你别慌乱
- Of course I am panicking. - No. Don't panic.

433
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,420
你一乱 我也乱
If you panic, I panic!

434
00:18:33,539 --> 00:18:35,580
我刚辞职了 小卡 老天啊
I just quit my job. Cam! My God.

435
00:18:35,580 --> 00:18:37,240
米奇尔 我过惯了好日子
Mitchell, I am used to nice things.

436
00:18:37,335 --> 00:18:38,520
以后要怎么办
What are we gonna do?

437
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:40,120
别慌 镇定下来
Okay. No, no. Just calm down.

438
00:18:40,185 --> 00:18:41,007
我来规划一下该怎么办
This is what we're gonna do.

439
00:18:41,007 --> 00:18:43,737
我要 我要用我的看家本领
I am going to- I'm gonna do what I'm trained to do.

440
00:18:43,737 --> 00:18:45,480
为达目的不惜说谎
I am going to lie, grovel, debase myself

441
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:46,420
卑躬屈膝 自我贬低
until I get what I want.

442
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,720
我可是律师 妈的
I am a lawyer, damn it.

443
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:48,160
米奇尔
Mitchell!

444
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:50,740
不要
No.

445
00:18:50,830 --> 00:18:52,803
提醒的好 忘了打领带
Oh, no, you're right. The tie.

446
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:55,320
我是说 我们一定能找到更合适你
No. We'll find something better for you,

447
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:56,920
而且对大家都好的办法
something that works for all of us.

448
00:18:57,060 --> 00:18:59,340
没有备用方案的 小卡
There's no Plan "B" here, Cam.

449
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:03,610
我们要还房贷 还要养个孩子
We have a mortgage. We have- We have a child to support.

450
00:19:03,670 --> 00:19:05,716
一切都会好的
Hey, it's gonna be okay.

451
00:19:05,785 --> 00:19:07,870
我们肯定有办法
We're gonna figure it out.

452
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:10,800
我只希望你开心 你一定会开心的
I just want you to be happy, and you will be happy.

453
00:19:11,580 --> 00:19:13,680
这才是值得庆祝的事
And that is something worth toasting.

454
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,118
喝那个便宜的吧
Let's just drink the cheap stuff,

455
00:19:18,118 --> 00:19:19,510
那瓶贵的我们转手卖掉吧
'cause we might have to sell that bottle.

456
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:26,140
说谎太多容易失眠
It's hard to sleep in a bed of lies.

457
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:27,060
对不对 杰
Isn't it, Jay?

458
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:29,600
小孩记性很差
Kids get over these things pretty quick.

459
00:19:29,660 --> 00:19:31,560
没准他现在像婴儿一样熟睡呢
He's probably sleeping like a baby right now.

460
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:34,820
他肯定是清醒着的 满心愧疚
I'm sure he's wide awake, full of guilt.

461
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:36,220
反正我要睡觉了
Well, I'm going to sleep.

462
00:19:47,020 --> 00:19:47,720
妈的
Damn it!

463
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:54,160
你好 杰
Hello, Jay.

464
00:19:56,020 --> 00:19:57,760
-你怎么不睡 -我在等待
- What are you doing up? - Waiting.

465
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:58,740
等什么
Waiting for what?

466
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:02,100
等真相 浣熊不是凶手 对吗
The truth. It wasn't a raccoon, was it?

467
00:20:02,158 --> 00:20:05,212
好了好了 被你发现了 是我的错
Oh, all right. You got me. I killed Shel.

468
00:20:05,280 --> 00:20:07,520
行了吧 对不起 我不是故意的
All right? I'm sorry. It was an accident.

469
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:09,000
你当时为什么不说实话
Why didn't you just tell me?

470
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,260
我不想惹你生气
Because I didn't want you to be upset with me.

471
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:13,940
我们一开始关系很僵
You and I got off to a rocky start.

472
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:15,460
最近 好不容易相处融洽了
Lately, it's been pretty good.

473
00:20:16,420 --> 00:20:17,940
我害怕毁了这一切
I was afraid I'd mess all that up

474
00:20:17,940 --> 00:20:19,800
所以不想让你知道是我杀死了你的宠物
if you knew that I was the one that killed your pet.

475
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,400
但你现在不仅杀了我的宠物
Now you're the guy who killed my pet

476
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:22,676
还编了个愚蠢的谎言
and made a stupid lie about it.

477
00:20:22,676 --> 00:20:23,800
我不觉得那是个愚蠢的谎言
Well, I don't think it was stupid.

478
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:24,920
我以为挺聪明的
I thought it was pretty clever.

479
00:20:27,140 --> 00:20:29,060
我只是不想重蹈覆辙
I was just trying to avoid past mistakes.

480
00:20:30,840 --> 00:20:31,320
听着
Look.

481
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:34,240
我知道我现在无法弥补对你造成的伤害
I know I can't make things all better right now,

482
00:20:34,340 --> 00:20:35,620
但我相信以后会的
but maybe over time.

483
00:20:36,060 --> 00:20:36,540
也许吧
Maybe.

484
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:39,000
好好睡吧
Get some rest.

485
00:20:40,040 --> 00:20:41,900
既然你已经坦白了 我也该坦白
Since we're confessing things,

486
00:20:41,976 --> 00:20:44,472
还记得你车上的抓痕吗
you know that scratch on your car?

487
00:20:44,560 --> 00:20:46,280
就是一直擦不掉的那个 记得
The one that can't be buffed out? Yeah?

488
00:20:46,340 --> 00:20:48,040
你应该猜得到是怎么回事
You should probably know how it happened.

489
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:49,540
我知道是怎么回事
I know how it happened.

490
00:20:51,300 --> 00:20:52,400
是浣熊干的
Raccoon did it.

491
00:20:54,860 --> 00:20:56,420
-晚安 杰 -晚安 小家伙
- Good night, Jay. -Good night, kid.

492
00:20:59,540 --> 00:21:00,660
我最大的成就
Best thing I ever did

493
00:21:00,660 --> 00:21:02,897
就是辞了份烂工作 自己创业
was quit a miserable job and start my own business.

494
00:21:02,897 --> 00:21:05,079
-谢谢老爸 -不过自己创业也不容易
- Thanks, Dad. - No, it's not gonna be easy.

495
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:07,100
所以我和歌洛莉亚来送你个东西
That's why Gloria and I wanna give you a little something

496
00:21:07,100 --> 00:21:08,600
帮你渡过难关
to help you through it.

497
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:09,800
爸爸 我不能
No, Dad, I can't.

498
00:21:09,820 --> 00:21:11,720
一定要给你 米奇
No. I want to, Mitch.

499
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:15,680
辞职之后 我特别想
Okay, but, I mean, as soon as I'm back on my feet, I really want to-

500
00:21:15,680 --> 00:21:19,180
爸爸 不要 你
Oh. Oh, Dad. No. You-

501
00:21:19,180 --> 00:21:21,540
20年前我的宠物蛇死了 你就想给我这个的
You tried to give me this 20 years ago when my pet snake died.

502
00:21:21,560 --> 00:21:23,060
-是吗 -是
- I did? -Yes.

503
00:21:23,165 --> 00:21:26,038
-叫扎扎·戈波娃 -这名字真可爱
- Zsa Zsa Gaboa? - Oh, that's adorable.

504
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:28,700
你当时真不知道他是同性恋
And you really didn't know that he was gay?

505
00:21:28,760 --> 00:21:30,780
我该知道的 对吧
I must've, right?
